      <category>Cipher Dispatch</category>
      <description>Spectrogram ciphers don&#x27;t hide messages in audio or in images — they hide them in the conversion between the two. The decode requires operating in exactly the liminal space where the cipher was built.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Instrumentable</title>
