      <category>Deep Decode</category>
      <description>Three papers, none of which mentions escape rooms, triangulate into a complete neural mechanism for why competitive puzzle formats don&#x27;t just impede insight — they systematically dismantle the network architecture insight requires. The cognitive cost of the clock is no longer theoretical. It&#x27;s measurable.</description>
